{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a responsive Shopify section matching the attached reference as closely as possible. It contains three areas: a custom-project banner, a two-column FAQ, and a bottom call-to-action banner.
    
    OVERALL STYLE
    - White background, clean sans-serif typography, dark charcoal text.
    - Centered container with an editable maximum width, default 1440px.
    - Approximately 30px desktop side gutters and 20px mobile gutters.
    - Minimal styling, generous whitespace, thin warm-gray borders.
    - Match the reference proportions and alignment.
    - No images, gradients, or decorative graphics.
    
    1. TOP CUSTOM-PROJECT BANNER
    - Full-width pale gray-blue panel, approximately #F2F5F6.
    - Thin light-gray border and 8px corner radius.
    - Approximately 32px horizontal padding and 24px vertical padding.
    - Desktop: text on the left, orange pill button on the right, vertically centered.
    - Heading: “A little outside the box?”
    - Heading approximately 24px, regular weight.
    - Supporting text below: “Custom design, advanced integrations, B2B, and ongoing marketing or SEO can be scoped separately.”
    - Supporting text approximately 14px, muted gray.
    - Button: “Discuss your project” followed by a small diagonal up-right arrow.
    - Button background approximately #FF7414, white bold text, fully rounded corners, subtle shadow.
    - Button approximately 280px wide and 60px tall at a 1440px viewport.
    
    2. FAQ AREA
    - Leave approximately 68px after the top banner.
    - Add a thin horizontal divider across the entire container above the FAQ.
    - Two-column desktop layout: left approximately 40%, right approximately 56%, with a generous gap.
    - Keep the FAQ introduction near the top of the left column.
    
    LEFT COLUMN
    - Small bold uppercase eyebrow: “GOOD QUESTIONS”.
    - Large regular-weight heading on two lines:
      “A few things”
      “to know.”
    - Heading approximately 46px with tight line height.
    - Muted supporting text: “Clarity before the first click.”
    - Supporting text approximately 16px.
    
    RIGHT COLUMN
    - Six accordion rows, initially closed.
    - Use these exact questions:
      1. Which package is right for my business?
      2. Are these one-time or monthly prices?
      3. How long will my store take to build?
      4. Can you migrate my existing store?
      5. What happens after launch?
      6. Can I request features outside a package?
    - Question text approximately 16px, regular weight.
    - Each row has generous vertical padding and a thin light-gray bottom border.
    - Place a small plus icon at the far right, aligned consistently.
    - Show a minus icon when a row is open.
    - Use plain rows without card backgrounds or rounded containers.
    - Only one accordion can be open at a time.
    - Animate opening and closing smoothly by transitioning the answer container height.
    - Answers should appear below the question in smaller muted text with comfortable line spacing.
    - Use accessible buttons with aria-expanded and associated answer panels.
    - Support keyboard interaction and reduced-motion preferences.
    
    Prefill these editable draft answers:
    1. “Launch suits a straightforward first store, Growth supports more customization, and Scale is designed for a bespoke build. We’ll help you choose based on your requirements.”
    2. “These are one-time project prices. Shopify subscriptions, paid themes, apps, and ongoing services are separate.”
    3. “Estimated timelines are 1–2 weeks for Launch, 3–5 weeks for Growth, and 8–12 weeks for Scale. Your final schedule is confirmed after reviewing the scope and required content.”
    4. “Yes. Migration options depend on your platform, data, and selected package. We’ll confirm what is included before the project begins.”
    5. “We provide handover guidance and the support agreed in your proposal. Ongoing maintenance and marketing can be scoped separately.”
    6. “Yes. Custom features, integrations, B2B requirements, and additional services can be quoted separately.”
    
    3. BOTTOM CALL-TO-ACTION BANNER
    - Leave approximately 60px below the FAQ.
    - Full-width solid cornflower-blue panel, approximately #699FF0.
    - Approximately 8px corner radius.
    - Approximately 40px horizontal padding and 36px vertical padding.
    - Desktop: text on the left and orange pill button on the right, vertically centered.
    - Large dark heading: “Big plans for your brand?”
    - Heading approximately 40px, regular weight.
    - Supporting text: “Let’s find the right way to bring them to life.”
    - Supporting text approximately 16px.
    - Button text: “Let’s build your next chapter” with a small diagonal up-right arrow.
    - Match the top button’s orange color, white bold text, rounded shape, and subtle shadow.
    - Bottom button should be wider to accommodate its text.
    
    MOBILE LAYOUT
    - Stack banner text and buttons vertically, aligned left.
    - Make buttons full width with comfortable padding and allow text to wrap if needed.
    - Stack the FAQ introduction above the accordions.
    - Reduce large headings to approximately 32px.
    - Use 24px internal banner padding.
    - Reduce vertical gaps to approximately 36–40px.
    - Keep plus/minus icons aligned right and prevent
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    font-family: {{ block.settings.body_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.body_font.fallback_families }};
    padding: 30px 20px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
  .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }} *,
  .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }} *::before,
  .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }} *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
  .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner { width: 100%; max-width: {{ block.settings.max_width }}px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__banner {
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 28px;
    padding: 24px 32px; background: {{ block.settings.top_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.border_color }}; border-radius: 8px;
  }
  .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__banner-copy { min-width: 0; }
  .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__top-title { margin: 0 0 7px; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.25; font-weight: 400; }
  .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__top-text { margin: 0; color: {{ block.settings.muted_color }}; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; }
  .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button {
    flex: 0 0 auto; min-height: 60px; padding: 14px 26px; display: inline-flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 12px;
    border: 0; border-radius: 999px; background: {{ block.settings.button_color }}; color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }};
    font: 700 15px/1.25 inherit; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 3px 8px rgba(35, 35, 35, .14); cursor: pointer;
  }
  .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button--top { width: 280px; }
  .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button--bottom { min-width: 310px; }
  .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button:focus-visible,
  .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__trigger:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #1b1b1b; outline-offset: 3px; }
  .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow { width: 15px; height: 15px; flex: 0 0 15px; }
  .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__faq { margin-top: 68px; padding-top: 34px; border-top: 1px solid {{ block.settings.border_color }}; display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 40fr) minmax(0, 56fr); gap: 4%; }
  .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__intro { padding-top: 2px; }
  .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow { margin: 0 0 20px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .08em; line-height: 1.3; }
  .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__faq-title { margin: 0; font-size: 46px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.03; letter-spacing: -.025em; }
  .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__intro-text { margin: 17px 0 0; color: {{ block.settings.muted_color }}; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; }
  .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__list { min-width: 0; }
  .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__item { border-bottom: 1px solid {{ block.settings.border_color }}; }
  .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__trigger {
    width: 100%; min-height: 72px; padding: 21px 0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px;
    border: 0; background: transparent; color: inherit; font: inherit; text-align: left; cursor: pointer;
  }
  .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__question { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.45; }
  .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon { position: relative; width: 16px; height: 16px; flex: 0 0 16px; }
  .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon::before,
  .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon::after { position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%; content: ''; background: currentColor; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); }
  .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon::before { width: 14px; height: 1.5px; }
  .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon::after { width: 1.5px; height: 14px; transition: opacity .25s ease; }
  .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__trigger[aria-expanded='true'] .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon::after { opacity: 0; }
  .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__panel { height: 0; overflow: hidden; transition: height .28s ease; }
  .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__answer { padding: 0 36px 21px 0; color: {{ block.settings.muted_color }}; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.65; }
  .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cta { margin-top: 60px; padding: 36px 40px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 28px; background: {{ block.settings.bottom_background }}; border-radius: 8px; }
  .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__bottom-title { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 40px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.12; letter-spacing: -.02em; }
  .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__bottom-text { margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; }
  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }} { padding: 24px 20px; }
    .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__banner, .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cta { align-items: stretch; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; padding: 24px; }
    .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__top-title { font-size: 22px; }
    .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button, .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button--top, .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button--bottom { width: 100%; min-width: 0; min-height: 56px; padding: 14px 18px; white-space: normal; }
    .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__faq { margin-top: 40px; padding-top: 28px; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 28px; }
    .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow { margin-bottom: 14px; }
    .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__faq-title { font-size: 32px; }
    .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__intro-text { margin-top: 12px; }
    .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__trigger { min-height: 66px; padding: 19px 0; gap: 16px; }
    .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__question { font-size: 15px; }
    .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cta { margin-top: 40px; }
    .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__bottom-title { font-size: 32px; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__panel, .ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon::after { transition: none; }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<div class="ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}" style="width: {{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner">
    <div class="ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__banner">
      <div class="ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__banner-copy">
        <h2 class="ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__top-title">{{ block.settings.top_heading | escape }}</h2>
        <p class="ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__top-text">{{ block.settings.top_text | escape }}</p>
      </div>
      <a class="ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button--top" href="{{ block.settings.top_link | default: '/pages/contact' }}">
        <span>{{ block.settings.top_button | escape }}</span>
        <svg class="ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 13 13 3M5 3h8v8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>

    <section class="ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__faq" aria-label="{{ block.settings.eyebrow | escape }}">
      <div class="ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__intro">
        <p class="ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow">{{ block.settings.eyebrow | escape }}</p>
        <h2 class="ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__faq-title">{{ block.settings.faq_heading }}</h2>
        <p class="ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__intro-text">{{ block.settings.faq_subheading | escape }}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__list" data-accordion>
        {% for i in (1..6) %}
          {% liquid
            assign question_key = 'question_' | append: i
            assign answer_key = 'answer_' | append: i
            assign question = block.settings[question_key]
            assign answer = block.settings[answer_key]
            assign panel_id = 'ai-faq-panel-' | append: ai_gen_id | append: '-' | append: i
          %}
          <div class="ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__item">
            <button class="ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__trigger" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="{{ panel_id }}">
              <span class="ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__question">{{ question | escape }}</span>
              <span class="ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            </button>
            <div class="ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__panel" id="{{ panel_id }}" aria-hidden="true" inert>
              <div class="ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__answer">{{ answer | escape }}</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cta">
      <div>
        <h2 class="ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__bottom-title">{{ block.settings.bottom_heading | escape }}</h2>
        <p class="ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__bottom-text">{{ block.settings.bottom_text | escape }}</p>
      </div>
      <a class="ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button--bottom" href="{{ block.settings.bottom_link | default: '/pages/contact' }}">
        <span>{{ block.settings.bottom_button | escape }}</span>
        <svg class="ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 13 13 3M5 3h8v8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
  (() => {
    const element = document.querySelector('.ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
    if (!element || element.dataset.accordionReady === 'true') return;
    element.dataset.accordionReady = 'true';
    const list = element.querySelector('[data-accordion]');
    const triggers = Array.from(list.querySelectorAll('.ai-pricing-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__trigger'));

    const closeItem = (trigger) => {
      const panel = element.querySelector(`#${CSS.escape(trigger.getAttribute('aria-controls'))}`);
      if (!panel || trigger.getAttribute('aria-expanded') !== 'true') return;
      trigger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');
      panel.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'true');
      panel.inert = true;
      panel.style.height = `${panel.scrollHeight}px`;
      requestAnimationFrame(() => { panel.style.height = '0px'; });
    };

    const openItem = (trigger) => {
      const panel = element.querySelector(`#${CSS.escape(trigger.getAttribute('aria-controls'))}`);
      if (!panel) return;
      trigger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'true');
      panel.inert = false;
      panel.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'false');
      panel.style.height = `${panel.scrollHeight}px`;
      const finish = (event) => {
        if (event.propertyName === 'height' && trigger.getAttribute('aria-expanded') === 'true') panel.style.height = 'auto';
      };
      panel.addEventListener('transitionend', finish, { once: true });
    };

    triggers.forEach((trigger) => {
      trigger.addEventListener('click', () => {
        const isOpen = trigger.getAttribute('aria-expanded') === 'true';
        triggers.forEach((other) => { if (other !== trigger) closeItem(other); });
        if (isOpen) closeItem(trigger); else openItem(trigger);
      });
    });
  })();
</script>

